# Split Component

Monitors 0xSplits smart contracts to track allocation changes, controller updates, and distribution events.

## Key Integration Pattern
Hierarchical group structure where each split group maintains its own accounts, controllers, and alert system with state persistence.

## Important Constraints
- Controller types (EOA/Safe) must be determined at initialization and handle type-specific monitoring logic
- Hash-based alert system tracks initial, recovery, and unknown hash changes for distribution monitoring